     "Hi everyone<br><br>Instats is excited to announce the launch of two new free AI tools for researchers, Research Assistant and Pathways, available now at <a href=\"http://instats.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://instats.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412865041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mqGIIUKLNw8vVfQLwNkI_\">instats.org</a><a href=\"https://instats.org/?utm_source=lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://instats.org/?utm_source%3Dlavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412865041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MPapvbl-pxrhXTCYP74cQ\">.</a> Both tools are <b>carbon-offset</b> by Instats via <a href=\"https://www.goldstandard.org/?utm_source=lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.goldstandard.org/?utm_source%3Dlavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412865041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rXWDTbS4cuonsK_SzP6YP\">Gold Standard</a>.<br><br><b>Research Assistant:</b> Get expert help with every Instats seminar to clarify concepts, ask technical questions, interpret results, troubleshoot code, and much more. It&#39;s privacy-preserving and IP-respecting. Look for the <b>AI Assistant</b> alongside videos and on <a href=\"https://instats.org/results?nav=On-Demand&amp;view=Seminars?utm_source=lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://instats.org/results?nav%3DOn-Demand%26view%3DSeminars?utm_source%3Dlavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412865041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1i_8YsFLQCFiwXL1kAmH68\">every Instats seminar</a>.<br><br><b><img width=\"531\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/meips/ADKq_NY6Iyc1c4D8gHj6c7x82SrfqlvLSLWH8FQWI6t1kYeR04VoG42BgMFimLsRYAlH31KMJGlnX39FY3Xc1fEGOIZTz4Liz9hMPKDxJ8Y=s0-d-e1-ft#https://list-manage.instats.org/uploads/1770113345.png\"></b><br><br><b>Pathways:</b> Describe your learning goals and get a personalized learning plan or a full curriculum. They&#39;re easy to save or share with your colleagues and students. <a href=\"https://instats.org/results?nav=Curriculum&amp;view=Seminars?utm_source=lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://instats.org/results?nav%3DCurriculum%26view%3DSeminars?utm_source%3Dlavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412865041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zpjApnTxHneppn-7Fn9QZ\">Build your pathway here</a>.<br><br><img width=\"535\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/uaz0TKuLIzmmIEoeG8BYgFyfPsMW-5dy7iQy6soNl5ovtV3RomoG2zRZPe1ddokFH2F-fUZZh2qMQGbIRMznHjDS1l7ybkhcpN5BRHsuQjm8Kc5XuWywxeaFTjA72KrVHG2cUJ15oh3oFHAtzMGj9HmOp6U6bQQxkJHR64Cayz8=s0-d-e1-ft#https://9f0aeba8cb72759b3bb557e3d45a1b4a.cdn.bubble.io/f1770181617235x993552059191269900/richtext_content.png\"><br><br>We hope you enjoy these free AI tools from Instats, your partner in research!<br><br><br>Best wishes<br><br>Michael Zyphur<br>Professor and Director<br>Instats | <a href=\"http://instats.org/?utm_source=lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://instats.org/?utm_source%3Dlavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412865041000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0NWYM34TNm6J3rhzGhB4U7\"><b>instats.org</b></a>"
